## Key Types and Structs

### Admitter Interface (`validating-webhook/validating-webhook.go`)

```go
type Admitter interface {
    Admit(*admissionv1.AdmissionReview) *admissionv1.AdmissionResponse
}
```

Implementations: `SecretAdmitter`, `PlanAdmitter`, `ProviderAdmitter`, `MigrationAdmitter`.

### Mutator Interface (`mutating-webhook/mutating-webhook.go`)

```go
type mutator interface {
    Mutate(*admissionv1.AdmissionReview) *admissionv1.AdmissionResponse
}
```

Implementations: `SecretMutator`, `PlanMutator`, `ProviderMutator`.

### PatchOperation (`webhooks/util/util.go`)

```go
type PatchOperation struct {
    Op    string      `json:"op"`
    Path  string      `json:"path"`
    Value interface{} `json:"value"`
}
```

Used by mutating webhooks to produce RFC 6902 JSON Patches.

